OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FAfter ITV News exposed years of
OL,7,Ffailure from the health authorities to
OL,8,Fprotect and monitor those exposed to
OL,9,Fthe drug, ministers have now
OL,10,Fcommissioned research on DES, as ITV
OL,11,FNews Social Affairs Correspondent
OL,12,FSarah Corker reports
OL,14,FThe Department of Health has asked
OL,15,Fscientists at Exeter University to
OL,16,Fcarry out research into the long-term
OL,17,Fimpact of the controversial pregnancy
OL,18,Fdrug DES, following an ITV News
OL,19,Finvestigation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31002
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FDiethylstilbestrol, commonly known as
OL,7,FDES, was a synthetic hormone
OL,8,Fprescribed to an estimated 300,000
OL,9,Fwomen on the NHS between the late
OL,10,F1930s and 1980s to treat several
OL,11,Fissues, including miscarriage, until
OL,12,Fit was linked to rare cancers and
OL,13,Finfertility in the daughters of those
OL,14,Fwho took it.
OL,16,FAfter ITV News exposed years of
OL,17,Ffailure from the health authorities to
OL,18,Fprotect and monitor those exposed to
OL,19,Fthe drug, ministers have now
OL,20,Fcommissioned research on DES, which is
OL,21,Fexpected to take at least six months.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FResearchers at Exeter University are
OL,7,Flooking for women exposed to DES
OL,8,Fduring pregnancy, their children,
OL,9,Fgrandchildren and great-grandchildren
OL,10,Fto share their experiences. Those
OL,11,Ftaking part in the project will
OL,12,Freceive #28.
OL,14,FIt is part of a systematic review of
OL,15,Fevidence on the drug, and aims to
OL,16,Fexamine the physical and mental health
OL,17,Feffects on families over time, as well
OL,18,Fas identifying gaps in the current
OL,19,Fevidence for future research.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FA leaflet sent to DES campaigners from
OL,7,Fthe university states that "the people
OL,8,Fexposed to DES before birth may have a
OL,9,Fhigher risk of some health problems,
OL,10,Fand it may also affect later
OL,11,Fgenerations".
OL,13,F"This study will help provide a
OL,14,Fclearer and more up-to-date
OL,15,Funderstanding of the long-term impact
OL,16,Fof DES," researchers said.
OL,18,FNHS England has also set up a DES
OL,19,Fadvisory group made up of senior
OL,20,Fclinicians to ensure that women
OL,21,Freceive the right medical treatment.
OL,26,@uD@AOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FThe remit of the group, which includes
OL,7,Fthe Patient Safety Commissioner, will
OL,8,Fbe to help establish local treatment
OL,9,Fpathways for DES patients within the
OL,10,FNHS, and to ensure that frontline
OL,11,Fstaff are aware of the
OL,12,Fintergenerational effects of the drug.
OL,14,FIt will also consider whether lifelong
OL,15,Fcancer screening is needed, something
OL,16,Fthat DES patients in other countries
OL,17,Fsuch as the Netherlands are offered.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FIf you or anyone you know has been
OL,7,Faffected by this issue or has a story
OL,8,Fto share, you can get in touch by
OL,9,Femailing: socialaffairs@itv.com
OL,11,FHenrietta Hughes, the Patient Safety
OL,12,FCommissioner, said: "What we've seen
OL,13,Fin other countries is that centres of
OL,14,Fexcellence have been established where
OL,15,Fthere is routine screening and
OL,16,Fmonitoring of people who've been
OL,17,Fexposed to DES; that's what I would
OL,18,Flike to see happen here.
OL,26,@tD@UOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31007
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,F"We need a real join-up in the system
OL,7,Fso that gynaecologists, cancer
OL,8,Fspecialists and also those dealing
OL,9,Fwith the psychological aspects are all
OL,10,Fbrought together in one place."
OL,12,FIn 1970, Jennifer Bradley, from Hale
OL,13,Fin Greater Manchester, was prescribed
OL,14,FDES for six months during her
OL,15,Fpregnancy with her daughter, after
OL,16,Fsuffering a miscarriage.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31008
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FShe recalled being told that the drug
OL,7,Fwas "completely safe" by doctors. Yet
OL,8,Fat that time there was already
OL,9,Fmounting scientific evidence from
OL,10,Faround the world of the drug's
OL,11,Fsinister side effects.
OL,13,FMs Bradley recalls watching a news
OL,14,Freport in the mid-70s about DES and
OL,15,Fraised concerns with her GP.
OL,17,F"He wouldn't even look at my notes,
OL,18,Fand he completely dismissed it," she
OL,19,Ftold ITV News.
OL,26,@yD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31009
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,F"He said that you don't worry about
OL,7,Fthings that never happen: 'You may
OL,8,Fwalk out of here and go under a bus,
OL,9,Fso don't worry about it'.
OL,11,F"I was outraged."
OL,13,FThe truth was her daughter Susie
OL,14,FMartin had been poisoned in the womb
OL,15,Fby DES.
OL,17,FShe has had lifelong gynaecological
OL,18,Fproblems, and since her teenage years
OL,19,Fhas had more than 20 surgeries and
OL,20,Foperations to remove abnormal cells.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31010
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,F"I am 40 times more likely to get
OL,7,Fcancer than those not DES exposed;
OL,8,Fit's not just reproductive cancer,
OL,9,Fit's breast cancer, pancreatic
OL,10,Fcancer," Ms Martin told ITV News.
OL,12,F"It's always hanging over you: are you
OL,13,Fsuddenly going to get a debilitating
OL,14,Fcancer? Most medical professionals
OL,15,Fstill don't know about the drug;
OL,16,Fthat's why this new research project
OL,17,Fis so important."
OL,26,@nD@AOUyD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31011
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FMs Bradley said she was "absolutely
OL,7,Ffurious" when she found out the truth,
OL,8,Fand added she "feels so sad and guilty
OL,9,Ffor what happened" to her daughter.
OL,11,FDES was once hailed as a wonder drug
OL,12,Fto prevent miscarriage, prescribed
OL,13,Faround the globe to millions of women.
OL,14,FIt's become a medical disaster.
OL,16,FMedical research suggests pregnant
OL,17,Fwomen who took DES may have a 30%
OL,18,Fhigher risk of breast cancer.
OL,26,@pD@OOUqD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31012
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FTheir daughters are 40 times more
OL,7,Flikely to develop clear cell
OL,8,Fadenocarcinoma of the vagina and
OL,9,Fcervix, a rare and aggressive form of
OL,10,Fcancer.
OL,12,FA long-running ITV News investigation
OL,13,Finto DES found that authorities did
OL,14,Fnot act upon warnings about the
OL,15,Fdangers of the drug, and the links to
OL,16,Fcancer were ignored for years.
OL,18,FIt was only after our team scoured
OL,19,Fthrough the public health archives
OL,20,Fthat we exposed the scale of failure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31013
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FThe Medicines and Healthcare products
OL,7,FRegulatory Agency (MHRA) had falsely
OL,8,Fclaimed that doctors were advised to
OL,9,Fstop using the drug for use in pre-
OL,10,Fmenopausal women in 1973, a statement
OL,11,Fthat our reporting has exposed as
OL,12,Finaccurate.
OL,14,FThe regulator then admitted that
OL,15,Finformation was incorrect, and the
OL,16,Fdrug was not stopped for use in
OL,17,Fpregnancy until the late 1980s, more
OL,18,Fthan a decade after cancer risks were
OL,19,Fknown.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31014
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FAn ITV News investigation exposed that
OL,7,Fwarnings over the sinister side
OL,8,Feffects of the drug DES were not acted
OL,9,Fon for decades, Social Affairs
OL,10,FCorrespondent Sarah Corker explains
OL,12,FIn September, the MHRA admitted it had
OL,13,Fmisled the public for up to 25 years
OL,14,Fabout when the drug was withdrawn and
OL,15,Fissued an apology.
OL,17,FThe Department of Health has requested
OL,18,Fthe regulator locate, where possible,
OL,19,Fmedical records detailing how many
OL,20,Fwomen were prescribed the drug.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31015
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FDrawing parallels with other pregnancy
OL,7,Fdrug scandals such as Thalidomide,
OL,8,FSodium Valproate and Primodos, the
OL,9,FPatient Safety Commissioner Henrietta
OL,10,FHughes told ITV News: "I think this is
OL,11,Fone of the great scandals that we have
OL,12,Fin our health system that the years
OL,13,Froll by.
OL,15,F"The health system doesn't listen, the
OL,16,Fgovernment doesn't act. Patients may
OL,17,Fexperience cancer, they may experience
OL,18,Fother harm and may die waiting to get
OL,19,Fan answer. I think that's totally
OL,20,Funacceptable."
OL,26,@rD@WOU|D@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31016
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FIn November 2025, the government
OL,7,Fadmitted "the state got this wrong" on
OL,8,FDES, and the then-Health Secretary Wes
OL,9,FStreeting personally apologised to
OL,10,Fthose impacted.
OL,12,FStreeting wrote a letter to victims of
OL,13,Fthe scandal recognising and
OL,14,Fapologising for their "harrowing"
OL,15,Fexperiences, adding that women
OL,16,F"understandably feel that their
OL,17,Fhealthcare system failed".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31017
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FThe Labour MP for Bournemouth West,
OL,7,FJessica Toale, who is leading the
OL,8,Fcalls for change at Westminster,
OL,9,Fwarned that many doctors still don't
OL,10,Fknow anything about DES.
OL,12,F"One woman I met had to buy a medical
OL,13,Fencyclopedia herself just to try to
OL,14,Ffind out what was wrong with her," she
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,26,@tD@AOUvD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31018
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,F"Symptoms are minimised, pain is
OL,7,Fdiminished, women are disbelieved,
OL,8,Fignored, often dismissed. That's why
OL,9,Fit's so important that GPs know about
OL,10,Fthis issue and know about some of the
OL,11,Fsymptoms and complications that these
OL,12,Fwomen can face."
OL,14,F"We massively need to change the way
OL,15,Fwomen's health is treated within the
OL,16,Fentire health system."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@PO]vD@AOUxD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31019
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FClare Fletcher, partner at Broudie
OL,7,FJackson Canter, representing the UK
OL,8,Fvictims of the DES scandal, said
OL,9,Fcampaigners are demanding a full
OL,10,Fpublic inquiry to get answers
OL,12,FAlongside specialist treatment, what
OL,13,Fmany DES women now want is a full
OL,14,Fpublic inquiry into how they were
OL,15,Ffailed so catastrophically for decades.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
