FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31020
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FClare Fletcher, partner at Broudie
OL,7,FJackson Canter, representing the UK
OL,8,Fvictims of the DES scandal, stressed
OL,9,Fthe urgency of an inquiry for
OL,10,Fsurvivors and their families, as many
OL,11,Fare getting older.
OL,13,F"If we don't get the answers we need,
OL,14,Fwe will be going to the new secretary
OL,15,Fof state and pushing for a full
OL,16,Fmeeting and demanding a full statutory
OL,17,Fpublic inquiry, so that they can get
OL,18,Fthe answers to what happened to them,"
OL,19,Fshe told ITV News.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G20/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
