OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,F"The mothers are now in their 80s and
OL,7,F90s, and they carry with them a huge
OL,8,Fguilt about the drug that they took in
OL,9,Fgood faith, and the impact that has
OL,10,Fhad on their children.
OL,12,F"For them, hearing the truth about
OL,13,Fwhat happened, understanding that it
OL,14,Fwasn't their fault and that the guilt
OL,15,Fthat they've carried wasn't their to
OL,16,Fcarry at all, is such an important
OL,17,Fthing.
OL,19,F"Truth without accountability causes
OL,20,Fmore harm than not."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G21/24
