OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,FA Department of Health and Social Care
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "The effects of DES
OL,8,Fare still being felt across
OL,9,Fgenerations, yet for too long health
OL,10,Fprofessionals were unaware of its
OL,11,Fimpacts and the support that should be
OL,12,Favailable to those exposed. But that
OL,13,Fis now changing under this government.
OL,26,@oD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G22/24
