OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785925101
OL,3,CDES drug scandal: Scientists to
OL,4,Cresearch long-term impact of exposure
OL,6,F"We are working with local Cancer
OL,7,FAlliances to ensure every NHS
OL,8,Fclinician is alive to the impact of
OL,9,FDES and the associated screening
OL,10,Fguidance, and we have commissioned a
OL,11,Fsystematic evidence review on the
OL,12,Fintergenerational effects of DES, to
OL,13,Fhelp strengthen support for those
OL,14,Fimpacted."
OL,16,FInformation or support about the
OL,17,Fissues raised in this report can be
OL,18,Ffound online:
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@JO]
